# SCIP's working files for certificate output (route 2), and the raw/
# completed VIPR forms once checked. symcert_certify_exact.py deletes
# anything over 50MB itself after viprchk runs, but a killed/still-running
# attempt can leave these behind meanwhile. Sizes and hashes of every form
# live in each cert_exact_*.json; the raw .pbp for route 1 is committed
# directly (these instances are small enough that it stays under the limit).
*.vipr
*.vipr_ori
*.vipr_der
*.vipr_complete
*_complete.vipr
*.fifo
